2608, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 364, "last_played": 1707521445, "avatar": "6e2564800710096f0c6b805daf3011e895972018"}, "language": "english", "review": "Wow this game... So small in bytes but massive in scale and in content.\n\nThis game is crazy hard but not maddening. You always know why you died even if the continuously says \"That was your fault\".\nThere's technique in how you play each character and I have only unlocked a second and only reached level 2/planet.\nThe longer you survive the harder it gets and it gets pretty hard when it's only spiked from VERY EASY to EASY.\nThe soundtrack keeps me playing though. The fact that it reminds me of some 80s sci-fi horro flick keeps me engrossed and also that I only lasted 20 MINUTES on the last playthrough before I was crushed gives me the drive to play again.\nThis game is fantastic whether you love it or hate it.", "timestamp_created": 1463331575, "timestamp_updated": 1463331575, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}